  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A ball rolls off the edge of a horizontal table with a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span>, as shown in the diagram. The table is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.25\\text{ m}\"></span> above the floor.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the horizontal distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span> from the edge of the table to the point where the ball strikes the floor? (Assume <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g = 10\\text{ m s}^{-2}\"></span> and air resistance is negligible.)</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50\\text{ m}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\\text{ m}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.25\\text{ m}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.5\\text{ m}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
